### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "correct-horse-battery", "fullName": "Alice" }

### Login (stores the token in a variable for the requests below)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "correct-horse-battery" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Open account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List accounts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Deposit (replace the account number)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/000000000000/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 250.00 }

### Transfer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccountNumber": "000000000000", "toAccountNumber": "111111111111", "amount": 40.00 }

### History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/000000000000/transactions?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}